ss_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"oIozEyiTSYh0T_YQRfpm5A","review_id":"9_1Erm4-a6-aYt1iEJr2DA","date":"2013-06-07T21:01:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9062250256538391,"text_excerpt":"What a cool concept. This pint sized restaurant is located inside of the Lakeview Grocery and is our go to spot when we do not want to cook. On steak nights, you can get a rib eye steak cooked anyway you like with a loaded baked potato for approximately $10.00. And I'm not talking about some 6 ounce petite portion. This is a huge boneless steak probably weighing in at 12 ounces or more. For $10.00, there's really no better deal around. I'm also a fan of \"burger nights\", where you can get a huge (maybe 1/2 lb) burger and a loaded baked potato for approximately $10.00. Although not quite on par with Port-O-Call, Snug Harbor or Lakeview Harbor; this burger holds its own taste wise and is a g..."},{"business_id":"oIozEyiTSYh0T_YQRfpm5A","review_id":"lzBHpUscvxYGDh1YLiOyZQ","date":"2016-07-26T15:14:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9037250280380249,"text_excerpt":"Good food, always well seasoned. Its good back up for a no cooking night. This store/take our restaurant is a local gem. A good place for reasonably priced Po' boys. You can order it then shop for your groceries while you wait."},{"business_id":"oIozEyiTSYh0T_YQRfpm5A","review_id":"BPCSs2MiiOAt7ROB7gzETA","date":"2019-10-21T16:42:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8957474827766418,"text_excerpt":"Love this place. Not only do they have an extensive selection of wine and dairy products (different brands of oat milk), but their prepared foods are out of this world. I haven't seen their tortellini salad anywhere else and I'm definitely addicted. It's right next to my workout studio and I can't imagine having a better place to pick up groceries on the way home."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
